cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Stop Arnaque 237: Cameroon Scam Reports Dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open, anonymized dataset of scams reported in Cameroon: scam messages, calls
  and schemes reported by people through a bilingual form, public scam alerts from
  fact-checkers, institutions, news sites and public social media posts, a table of
  pseudonymized scammer numbers, and genuine operator messages for comparison.
authors:
